{"s":73,"v":[{"t":"O you who wraps himself [in clothing]","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O you","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلْمُزَّمِّلُ","who wraps himself","l-muzamilu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُزَّمِّلُ",4344]]]]},{"t":"Arise [to pray] the night, except for a little -","w":[["قُمِ","Stand","qumi",""],["ٱلَّيْلَ","(in) the night","al-layla","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلَ",150]]],["إِلَّا","except","illā",""],["قَلِيلًۭا","a little","qalīlan",""]]},{"t":"Half of it - or subtract from it a little","w":[["نِّصْفَهُۥٓ","Half of it","niṣ'fahu","",[["نِّصْفَ",1111],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["أَوِ","or","awi",""],["ٱنقُصْ","lessen","unquṣ",""],["مِنْهُ","from it","min'hu","",[["مِنْ",6],["هُ",5]]],["قَلِيلًا","a little","qalīlan",""]]},{"t":"Or add to it, and recite the Qur’ān with measured recitation.","w":[["أَوْ","Or","aw",""],["زِدْ","add","zid",""],["عَلَيْهِ","to it","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["وَرَتِّلِ","and recite","warattili","",[["وَ",1],["رَتِّلِ",2381]]],["ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","the Quran","l-qur'āna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُرْءَانَ",186]]],["تَرْتِيلًا","(with) measured rhythmic recitation","tartīlan",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, We will cast upon you a heavy word.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["سَنُلْقِى","will cast","sanul'qī","",[["سَ",118],["نُلْقِى",180]]],["عَلَيْكَ","upon you","ʿalayka","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["كَ",18]]],["قَوْلًۭا","a Word","qawlan",""],["ثَقِيلًا","heavy","thaqīlan",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, the hours of the night are more effective for concurrence [of heart and tongue] and more suitable for words.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["نَاشِئَةَ","(the) rising","nāshi-ata",""],["ٱلَّيْلِ","(at) the night","al-layli","",[["ٱلَّ",2],["يْلِ",150]]],["هِىَ","it","hiya",""],["أَشَدُّ","(is) very hard","ashaddu",""],["وَطْـًۭٔا","and most potent","waṭan",""],["وَأَقْوَمُ","and more suitable","wa-aqwamu","",[["وَ",1],["أَقْوَمُ",1455]]],["قِيلًا","(for) Word","qīlan",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, for you by day is prolonged occupation.","w":[["